molten-input 1
axis "moveX" negative A Left positive D Right gamepad LeftX joystick 0
axis "moveZ" negative W Up positive S Down gamepad LeftY inverted joystick 1
button "jump" keys Space gamepad A
button "fire" keys Space gamepad X mouse Left
button "pause" keys Escape gamepad Start
axis "yaw" negative Q positive E gamepad RightX joystick 3
axis "throttle" negative LeftControl Z positive LeftShift X
axis "throttleLever" negative positive joystick 2
button "flaps" keys F gamepad Y
button "brake" keys B gamepad B
